<title>UK: LME slow on pre-market, prices hold at lows.</title>
<headline>LME slow on pre-market, prices hold at lows.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Edges up from lows in light trade. Still seen vulnerable on downside, despite being oversold.</p>
<p>ZINC - Initial slide in thin trade arrested and reversed by 5,175-tonne stock fall.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Holds at modestly lower levels. Watching spread tightness. OTHERS - Slow.</p>
</text>
